<programme start="20261108110000 +0000" stop="20261108115500 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Islands: Nature&apos;s Wild Laboratories</title><sub-title lang="en">Okavango</sub-title><desc lang="en">In the Okavango Delta, the desert sun battles with floodwaters; every animal, whether termite queen or elephant bull, must cope with the never-ending changes.</desc><date>20250606</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ce419c869ebc7e9b418e4d84ff5dc3ef.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108115500 +0000" stop="20261108125400 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wonders of Nature</title><sub-title lang="en">On the Defence</sub-title><desc lang="en">The animals are willing to do whatever it takes to protect their food, young ones, and territories. Some of their strategies can put the smartest of human beings in the shade.</desc><date>20210514</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c2287b44edd3cb15fba2f07f9f5479bf.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108125400 +0000" stop="20261108135400 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Secret Life of the Tasmanian Devil</title><sub-title lang="en">Young Devils</sub-title><desc lang="en">March is the breeding month of the Devils and the pregnancy lasts about eighteen days; the litter is usually about twenty, but there are only four nipples, to which the first pups will arrive, and the rest will die.</desc><credits><actor>Virge Gilchrist</actor></credits><date>20210406</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/6794b481417c03ab790df20d59fb1e48a9d4eaa5.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108135400 +0000" stop="20261108145400 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wildlife Icons</title><sub-title lang="en">The Clean Up Crew</sub-title><desc lang="en">Winter in Marakele National Park is one of the scarcest, but also most plentiful, times of the year; looking at how a giraffe&apos;s demise becomes a source of life for the region&apos;s vultures, who depend on the decaying flesh of animals like these.</desc><date>20170121</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/83fcc0af7f14f71347a667a48d0213db9c3ed2de.JPEG"/></programme>
