<programme start="20261107210000 +0000" stop="20261107220000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Amor compartido</sub-title><desc lang="es">Samara descubre que Aruna era el soldado enmascarado. Ruth se molesta al saber que no tendrá una boda y debe compartir el amor de Boán. Gibar le exige a Otniel que se aleje de Acsa.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.78.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E79</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/4a031b23bac953717ac7f2e18366afff.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107220000 +0000" stop="20261107230000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Amor por conveniencia</sub-title><desc lang="es">Acán le dice a Gibar que debe casarse con Acsa para poder convertirse en líder. Kalú y Kira descubren que la señora Zaira es una bruja.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.79.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E80</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6238c9de1794548c180f27bc5448ad77.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107230000 +0000" stop="20261108000000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Un buen esposo</sub-title><desc lang="es">Kalú hace un plan con sus amigos para escapar de Zaira. Rahab y sus hermanos aprenden sobre el Dios de Israel. Quemuel le dice a Samara que conseguirá un marido para ella.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.80.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E81</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/9e6f4f71295bc1792d08910bb5c69650.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108000000 +0000" stop="20261108010000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Propuesta rechazada</sub-title><desc lang="es">Caleb rechaza la propuesta de matrimonio que Gibar le hizo a Acsa. Samara se rehúsa a olvidar a Josué y le propone a Leia matar a Aruna. Zaqueo le propone matrimonio a Chaia.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.81.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E82</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/00bbbe8642d13ca713aaa82bc6b3270d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108010000 +0000" stop="20261108020000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">La elegida</sub-title><desc lang="es">Otoniel le dice a Josué que vio huellas de un gigante. Gibar trata de seducir a Acsa para que se case con él. Caleb acepta entrenar con Aruna.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.82.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E83</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/25a48d45484762788d652cfccc0bdfe6.jpeg"/></programme>
